    "detailed_description": "The war against Professor Zor was won, but the price was high.<br>Technologies were destroyed. Only a few ancient flying machines remain.<br>Professor Zor might still be alive and start another war. You must prevent that!<br><br>You play an experienced pilot who must penetrate a huge, long-forgotten cave system with historical airplanes and airships.<br><br>Your fuel is limited and your damage points are low. Equipped only with simple weapons, the mission seems almost hopeless.<br>Moreover, the constantly increasing level of difficulty and powerful bosses will challenge your flying and weapon skills.<br><br>Never touch the cave floor and refuel at airports before you run out of fuel!<br>Look for machine gun, bomb, protection, and range upgrades. Have them installed by your team at the airport.<br>Find fuel and shields in order to complete your mission and reach the next airport.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main features:</strong></h2><br>The game is a sidescroller in a 3D world with physics calculation. When you fly a turn, the plane does not move in spatial depth.<br>Nevertheless, the force of gravity is at work as well as the uplift force of the plane, which only occurs from a certain speed.<br>The planes drift, glide, and crash, too. Depending on whether you accelerate or not.<br>Depending on your speed when you collide with something, you take more or less damage. A hard landing will damage your plane!<br><br>Unlike in the old arcade games, you have an infinite number of lives.<br>The airports serve as checkpoints and, as soon as you have landed at the specified airport after completing the mission, your game is saved automatically.<br><br>An arcade game without points? There is not any! Here, too, you get points for kills, for collected items and when you have completed missions quickly.<br><br>In the course of the game, you will use different flying machines.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/4c80726e5a2ca6dc6e60d4c297925127.poster.avif?t=1728901757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/4c80726e5a2ca6dc6e60d4c297925127.webm?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/4c80726e5a2ca6dc6e60d4c297925127.mp4?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Biplane: Agile, economical, and lightly armed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/8a576d740fb81ec1b824e15bd1b69620.poster.avif?t=1728901757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/8a576d740fb81ec1b824e15bd1b69620.webm?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/8a576d740fb81ec1b824e15bd1b69620.mp4?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Airship: Slow, can fly backwards and can glide. Armed only with bombs and very vulnerable. Can't land at airports.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/e5d2633cc4cb791c06af85bb68e48387.poster.avif?t=1728901757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/e5d2633cc4cb791c06af85bb68e48387.webm?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/e5d2633cc4cb791c06af85bb68e48387.mp4?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Fighter: Fast, thirsty, well-armed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/5ebff38e6fba981a251b3cb6a98c39be.poster.avif?t=1728901757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/5ebff38e6fba981a251b3cb6a98c39be.webm?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/5ebff38e6fba981a251b3cb6a98c39be.mp4?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Bomber: Very heavily armed, thirsty, and very sluggish in flight.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/2bda7866c62542c2e30f025dbaf4c601.poster.avif?t=1728901757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/2bda7866c62542c2e30f025dbaf4c601.webm?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499710/extras/2bda7866c62542c2e30f025dbaf4c601.mp4?t=1728901757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Jet: Very fast, thirsty, well- to very well-armed.",
